# Data Rules

## Owned by Claude Code
Files in /lib/, /types/, /data/, /content/ are Claude Code's domain.
Cursor should not edit these unless explicitly instructed.

## Type reference
All types live in /types/index.ts.
Key types: Incident · OralHistory · StatusType · IncidentObject · PullQuote · NavItem · FilterOption

## Ref formats
- Incidents: INC-YYYY-XXX
- Oral histories: OHT-YYYY-XXX  
- Objects: OBJ-XXX
- Documents: DOC-YYYY-XXX

## Utility functions
```
/lib/incidents.ts
  getAllIncidents(): Incident[]
  getIncidentByRef(ref: string): Incident | undefined
  getFeaturedIncidents(): Incident[]
  getOpenIncidents(): Incident[]
  getDisputedIncidents(): Incident[]

/lib/oral-histories.ts
  getAllOralHistories(): OralHistory[]
  getOralHistoryByRef(ref: string): OralHistory | undefined
  getOralHistoriesByIncidentRef(incidentRef: string): OralHistory[]
```

## No runtime DB calls
All data functions read from flat JSON files synchronously using fs and path.
No fetch(). No async data utilities (pages handle async via React server components).
